    <item>
      <title>Orbit 0.2.0-alpha</title>
      <sparkle:version>3</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.0-alpha</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <h3>What's new in 0.2.0-alpha</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Smoother mesh streaming</strong> — responses from the shared mesh now fade in token by token rather than appearing one word at a time.</li>
          <li><strong>Clearer status colours</strong> — shared mesh indicator is now blue. Green = running locally, teal = your private mesh, blue = shared mesh.</li>
          <li><strong>Faster Models tab</strong> — switching to Mesh Network no longer re-fetches models on every visit; the cached list appears instantly.</li>
          <li><strong>Mesh speed notice</strong> — a new info banner in the Models tab explains that response speed naturally varies on the shared mesh.</li>
          <li><strong>Architecture improvements</strong> — internal refactor for reliability and testability; no user-visible behaviour changes.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
      <sparkle:releaseNotesLink>
        https://github.com/keranm/orbit-release/releases/tag/v0.2.0-alpha
      </sparkle:releaseNotesLink>
